+``proxy_port`` specifies the port that a Service using a :ref:`custom start command <bentoml-custom-command>` is expected to bind. BentoML forwards requests to that port through an in-process reverse proxy. The default is ``8000``.
+
+.. code-block:: python
+
+    @bentoml.service(
+        cmd=["uvicorn", "myapp:app", "--host", "127.0.0.1", "--port", "9000"],
+        http={"proxy_port": 9000},
+    )
+    class MyService:
+        # Service implementation
+
